ting personal beliefs and  i'm going to help you bust through that  and that's honestly the biggest the  biggest  lesson that you can learn is how to bust  through your limiting personal beliefs  because you're operating this bubble we  all are i'm operating my own bubble  and every time you break through  a limiting personal belief you grow  and every major breakthrough that i've  had in my business has come  from busting through a limiting personal  belief and so i'm going to challenge you  to do that  and we're going to break through a lot  of librarian personal beliefs because if  you want to change the world  what you're doing now is not enough it's  not working  right you need to have a bigger impact  you're gonna have to be the best version  of yourself  to get there and it's totally possible  and with my coaching you'll get there  on top of that it's gonna be broadcast  live  to my youtube channel talk about being  put on the spot  this is important because i want people  to follow you  i want people to know who you are i want  you to be a known quantity  to my audience and and eventually to the  world and so  you know companies pay me thousands of  dollars for that kind of exposure  on my channel and that's included for  you guys who are part of the coaching  program  the best part of my day is seeing the  comments that come in on youtube  seeing you guys supporting me and saying  how great something was and how it  impacted their lives  i want that same thing for you because  it's hard  being in business right every day is a  struggle especially in the early days  and you doubt yourself  you're not sure if you're going to make  it and seeing not just my  support and saying hey keep going this  is great you're doing a good job you're  on track  but also people leaving comments and  encouraging you and asking questions  it's fuel it's motivation it gets you  going in the morning and you need that  to be able to succeed okay on top of  that is showing you aga