t  to be a part of that  your work has to be important to justify  the time and so  if you have a question for me i want to  make sure that i can get back to you in  a timely manner  finally get social attention for me okay  i'm going to be following you on twitter  i'm going to be following you on  facebook i'm going to be following you  on youtube i'm going to be  commenting on your stuff i'm going to be  telling you when something  needs to be worked on and improved and  how to do it i'm going to tell you when  you like something  if i love it i'm going to share it with  my audience and give you a lot more  exposure in the process  you're going to get me hounding you  saying hey you know you didn't post  anything  what's going on i spent a lot of time on  social media so you're going to be  hearing a lot from me  and ps you're going to be part of the  family what i want to do really is build  a small network of people who are all  trying to change the world and you can  learn from each other  and support each other and follow each  other and comment on each other's stuff  because  that is there's so much knowledge and  value and motivation and inspiration  that comes from connecting with  like-minded entrepreneurs  the biggest challenge that most people  have is their environment holds you back  right the people you surround yourself  with the media you consume  the environment that you set up wherever  you work it's holding you where you are  it's holding you doing whatever you're  doing right now it's so hard to bust  through  to really break out you have to create  an environment and  people around you who are supportive  who are trying to do something just as  big as you are i want you to join the  family  and have everybody who was part of the  program  as a sounding board as people who are in  your network as people who you can talk  to as people who you can get inspiration  from  because the people who you surround  yourself with will help determine  how far you go on your path to changing  the world  so if that sounds interesting you want  to learn more you can check out  evidence.com  movement you can see more details about  the program you can email me if you're  interested  and i hope to hear from you soon believe

